WEBVTT

00:23.840 --> 00:28.839
(Based on Softstar Technology
single-player game "Chinese Paladin 3")

00:28.840 --> 00:35.359
(Copyright Notice)

00:35.360 --> 00:36.879
(Viewers under the age of majority
should watch with guardian permission.)

00:36.880 --> 00:38.689
(The content depicted in this film
is fictional.)

00:38.690 --> 00:40.520
(Do not imitate in real life.)

00:58.820 --> 01:01.789
♪Blades of wind cut through dark clouds,
sunset flares to life♪

01:01.790 --> 01:04.060
♪Staining the vast sky red♪

01:04.550 --> 01:09.720
♪A fierce spirit forges a sacred sword,
unafraid of demons♪

01:10.300 --> 01:13.089
♪Breaking the heavens,
shattering the shrouded dark♪

01:13.090 --> 01:15.959
♪Breaking the dream,
thorns blinding the way♪

01:15.960 --> 01:18.379
♪Breaking love,
trapped in hatred and obsession♪

01:18.380 --> 01:21.129
♪The sword's edge ignites
with burning blood♪

01:21.130 --> 01:24.109
♪Fight to the fullest♪

01:24.110 --> 01:26.899
♪Burn to the fullest♪

01:26.900 --> 01:29.689
♪For the one I love♪

01:29.690 --> 01:32.439
♪No regrets whether laughter or tears♪

01:32.440 --> 01:35.239
♪I never stop searching♪

01:35.240 --> 01:38.460
♪I never stop falling♪

01:41.020 --> 01:44.130
♪A furious roar shakes the earth
and pierces the sky♪

01:53.760 --> 01:56.799
=Sword and Fairy 3=

01:56.800 --> 01:59.160
=Episode 9=
=True and False Qing Wei=

02:07.320 --> 02:08.840
We have finally reached
the mountain gate.

02:10.140 --> 02:11.340
Who goes there?

02:12.150 --> 02:14.819
Fellow Taoist, we came up from
the foot of the mountain.

02:14.820 --> 02:16.580
We are seeking Xu Changqing
of Shu Mountain.

02:16.870 --> 02:18.980
We have an important matter
to discuss with him.

02:23.120 --> 02:25.590
I see. You are here
to deliver a sword, correct?

02:25.820 --> 02:27.500
Uncle Changqing is at Wuji Pavilion.

02:27.540 --> 02:28.500
Please follow me.

02:30.420 --> 02:31.860
Deliver a sword?

02:32.260 --> 02:33.260
What does that mean?

02:45.380 --> 02:49.340
I never imagined I would one day
enter Shu Mountain.

02:49.660 --> 02:52.420
This truly is a paradise
in the mortal realm.

02:52.940 --> 02:55.139
It is said Shu Mountain
is rooted in the divine tree,

02:55.140 --> 02:57.980
a floating mountain formed
from Pangu's heart.

02:58.620 --> 03:00.179
The Shu Mountain Sect

03:00.180 --> 03:02.460
is the greatest cultivation sect
in the mortal realm.

03:02.540 --> 03:03.620
Shu Mountain

03:03.660 --> 03:06.100
also stands at the head
of the seventy-two immortal realms.

03:06.180 --> 03:08.380
Too bad Kui is still sleeping
inside the sword.

03:08.620 --> 03:11.660
She will only see this
once she has rested.

03:13.660 --> 03:14.499
Hua Ying.

03:14.500 --> 03:15.620
You are awake.

03:18.420 --> 03:19.020
Hey.

03:19.060 --> 03:19.940
Hua Ying.

03:19.980 --> 03:21.300
Do not go too far.

03:22.780 --> 03:24.300
Let her look around.

03:24.460 --> 03:25.499
This is Shu Mountain.

03:25.500 --> 03:26.700
It is quite safe here.

03:26.900 --> 03:27.620
Mm.

03:37.140 --> 03:37.980
Whoa.

03:38.260 --> 03:39.460
Fine swords.

03:39.500 --> 03:40.740
All of them are fine swords.

03:41.180 --> 03:44.700
Blazing Iron, Mystic Ice,
Clear Wind, Dragon Spring.

03:45.060 --> 03:45.740
Hey.

03:45.900 --> 03:47.299
So many fine swords.

03:47.300 --> 03:48.540
What are they all for?

03:48.580 --> 03:49.940
By order of the clan master,

03:50.180 --> 03:53.100
all renowned swords in the Sword Repository
are to be inspected today.

03:53.320 --> 03:55.280
We were instructed to take them
out and deliver them.

03:56.140 --> 03:57.140
Oh.

03:57.260 --> 03:59.700
No wonder they thought we were here
to deliver swords as well.

04:02.740 --> 04:03.780
Changqing.

04:04.980 --> 04:05.739
Changqing.

04:05.740 --> 04:07.260
None of these will do.

04:10.260 --> 04:12.039
You have returned
to the Shu Mountain Sect?

04:12.040 --> 04:14.250
Lady, men and women
should not have physical contact.

04:14.820 --> 04:17.140
Especially here,
a place of pure cultivation.

04:17.220 --> 04:19.379
Changqing, what do you mean by this?

04:19.380 --> 04:21.620
Why are you pretending
not to know Zi Xuan?

04:23.060 --> 04:24.140
That sword.

04:24.540 --> 04:25.860
Let me see it.

04:28.300 --> 04:30.140
Careful. Something is wrong with Changqing.

04:30.820 --> 04:32.660
That sword belongs to Shu Mountain.

04:32.780 --> 04:34.130
Return it at once.

04:35.950 --> 04:37.219
Changqing, what is wrong with you?

04:37.220 --> 04:39.019
Changqing, wake up.

04:39.020 --> 04:41.340
Your senior brother is being controlled
by something evil.

04:42.380 --> 04:43.180
Hmph.

04:43.300 --> 04:44.900
You are the evil ones.

04:45.380 --> 04:46.700
Disciples, heed my command.

04:46.860 --> 04:48.380
Defeat evil and uphold the path.

04:49.140 --> 04:50.380
Kill them.

04:50.780 --> 04:52.140
Changqing has been deceived.

04:52.300 --> 04:54.100
Do not take their lives.

04:56.630 --> 04:58.420
Changqing, forgive me.

05:19.180 --> 05:21.780
Your sword techniques
lack all structure.

05:21.860 --> 05:24.700
And you dare flaunt them
before the Shu Mountain Sect?

05:27.460 --> 05:29.500
(All my moves have been seen through.)

05:29.740 --> 05:30.459
(In swordsmanship,)

05:30.460 --> 05:32.460
(I am no match for Changqing at all.)

05:32.940 --> 05:34.700
(But if I use
the Demon Sword techniques,)

05:35.040 --> 05:37.880
(with the Demon Sword's destructive power,
what if I end up hurting Changqing?)

05:38.660 --> 05:40.939
(But I have no other choice now.)

05:40.940 --> 05:42.940
(I will try to make him stop first.)

06:07.020 --> 06:08.180
Jing Tian.

06:09.220 --> 06:10.380
Jing Tian.

06:16.380 --> 06:19.460
Changqing, look at me.

06:27.620 --> 06:30.820
Come out. I know it is you.

06:34.340 --> 06:38.259
Shu Mountain is now the place
where I cultivate and refine myself.

06:38.260 --> 06:40.500
What business do you have here?

06:41.490 --> 06:42.779
Why is it this fake?

06:42.780 --> 06:44.699
(What makes him so special)

06:44.700 --> 06:46.700
(that he can control
Shu Mountain disciples?)

06:47.440 --> 06:49.860
That sword is the key.

06:50.820 --> 06:52.300
Hand it over to me.

06:52.620 --> 06:53.460
Not a chance.

07:00.620 --> 07:03.259
Demon, you dare impersonate
the clan master of Shu Mountain.

07:03.260 --> 07:04.820
Reveal your true form at once.

07:09.600 --> 07:11.560
(Immobilization Bind)

07:20.340 --> 07:21.460
Changqing.

07:24.270 --> 07:25.280
Zi Xuan.

07:25.460 --> 07:26.420
I am sorry.

07:27.350 --> 07:28.380
Are you alright?

07:28.500 --> 07:29.540
I am fine.

07:29.820 --> 07:30.900
The wound is not deep.

07:31.340 --> 07:32.740
This is all my fault.

07:34.260 --> 07:35.859
I still held a trace of obsession,

07:35.860 --> 07:37.500
wanting to return to Shu Mountain.

07:37.540 --> 07:39.420
That demon took advantage of it.

07:40.400 --> 07:42.220
I almost committed a grave mistake.

07:42.980 --> 07:43.980
I do not blame you.

07:44.020 --> 07:45.060
Look over there.

07:48.900 --> 07:50.740
What kind of demon is he?

07:59.620 --> 08:00.540
Master.

08:00.710 --> 08:06.099
Qing Wei, you trapped me in
the Demon-Sealing Pagoda and left me to perish.

08:06.100 --> 08:09.180
You never expected
this day to come, did you?

08:10.060 --> 08:13.180
But what can you do to me now
that you are here?

08:13.460 --> 08:16.900
He is the Evil Sword Immortal,
the embodiment of malevolent thoughts.

08:17.020 --> 08:20.259
The four elders and I are guarding
the Demon-Sealing Pagoda.

08:20.260 --> 08:22.619
We can only arrive
through spirit projection,

08:22.620 --> 08:24.220
in spiritual form.

08:24.300 --> 08:26.259
Fight him with all you have.

08:26.260 --> 08:28.579
I will support you from here.

08:28.580 --> 08:29.700
Understood, Master.

08:33.900 --> 08:36.580
You will never kill me.

08:37.020 --> 08:39.930
Shu Mountain Heavenly Sword Technique.

08:53.380 --> 08:58.299
Insolent nobody,
you destroyed my cultivation.

08:58.300 --> 09:01.220
I will kill you.

09:01.660 --> 09:02.460
Zi Xuan.

09:07.900 --> 09:08.700
Zi Xuan.

09:09.180 --> 09:09.980
Zi Xuan.

09:11.380 --> 09:13.260
Did that demon escape again?

09:14.500 --> 09:16.260
To be honest, it is shameful to admit,

09:16.300 --> 09:21.700
even the elders and I only sensed
something wrong once he revealed his true form.

09:21.820 --> 09:25.620
The Shu Mountain barrier cannot stop
the Evil Sword Immortal for now.

09:26.020 --> 09:28.819
However, he has just
suffered a heavy blow.

09:28.820 --> 09:31.420
He will not be able
to stir trouble anytime soon.

09:31.850 --> 09:33.659
Disciples of Shu Mountain,
heed my command.

09:33.660 --> 09:37.299
If you encounter me or any other
elder outside the Demon-Sealing Pagoda,

09:37.300 --> 09:38.579
do not trust them lightly.

09:38.580 --> 09:41.619
You must go to the Demon-Sealing Pagoda
to confirm with us.

09:41.620 --> 09:42.660
- Yes.
- Yes.

09:44.220 --> 09:47.300
Do not panic. She will be fine.

09:55.600 --> 09:57.260
Thank you, Clan Master.

09:58.060 --> 10:00.300
Zi Xuan, how are you feeling?

10:00.380 --> 10:02.899
I am fine. Do not worry.

10:02.900 --> 10:04.020
Changqing.

10:04.180 --> 10:06.180
Miss Zi Xuan needs proper rest.

10:06.260 --> 10:08.059
Take her to rest first.

10:08.060 --> 10:09.180
Alright.

10:11.240 --> 10:13.560
(Shu Mountain. Wuji Pavilion)
Thank you, Master, for treating Zi Xuan.

10:13.740 --> 10:15.140
I am deeply grateful.

10:15.700 --> 10:16.860
You may rise.

10:17.540 --> 10:19.420
This young friend's sword techniques

10:19.460 --> 10:22.460
seem to carry the foundations
of the Shu Mountain Sect.

10:22.900 --> 10:25.499
Master, Changqing taught Tian
the Shu Mountain inner arts

10:25.500 --> 10:27.139
without the sect's permission,

10:27.140 --> 10:27.899
solely to...

10:27.900 --> 10:29.620
Protect his life.

10:30.340 --> 10:32.779
This young friend
is exceptionally gifted.

10:32.780 --> 10:35.619
To walk the righteous path
alongside the Demon Sword

10:35.620 --> 10:37.380
is also a form of merit.

10:38.220 --> 10:39.500
Changqing,

10:39.700 --> 10:42.300
I understand your compassionate heart.

10:42.340 --> 10:46.499
After all, what he wields
is no ordinary blade,

10:46.500 --> 10:47.859
but the Demon Sword.

10:47.860 --> 10:48.980
Clan Master Qing Wei,

10:49.180 --> 10:52.459
this sword truly belongs to Shu Mountain?

10:52.460 --> 10:53.339
Then

10:53.340 --> 10:55.820
does it need to be returned?

10:55.980 --> 10:57.139
No.

10:57.140 --> 10:59.859
Shu Mountain
bound the Demon Sword in the past,

10:59.860 --> 11:02.939
but you now hold its future.

11:02.940 --> 11:06.260
The future of the Demon Sword?

11:08.980 --> 11:14.459
The obsessions and resentment
within this Demon Sword run deep.

11:14.460 --> 11:18.380
It is exactly
what the Evil Sword Immortal seeks.

11:18.480 --> 11:20.359
We must not let that demon
obtain the Demon Sword.

11:20.359 --> 11:21.979
Otherwise, what about Kui?

11:21.980 --> 11:23.260
Who is Kui?

11:23.540 --> 11:24.660
Kui...

11:24.860 --> 11:27.420
She lives inside this Demon Sword.

11:30.340 --> 11:32.819
So this Demon Sword

11:32.820 --> 11:36.260
originally belonged to Prince Long Yang
and Princess Long Kui of the Jiang Kingdom.

11:36.580 --> 11:40.139
The Demon Sword was forged
from the siblings' obsession,

11:40.140 --> 11:42.500
nurtured by the resentment
of wronged souls.

11:43.180 --> 11:44.580
The Evil Sword Immortal,

11:44.780 --> 11:46.739
on the other hand, is the karmic seed

11:46.740 --> 11:50.139
we five elders sowed
while pursuing a half-immortal body,

11:50.140 --> 11:51.860
and the bitter result it bore.

11:52.100 --> 11:54.140
No wonder the Shu Mountain barrier
cannot restrain him.

11:55.060 --> 11:57.939
Back then, my fellow disciples and I,

11:57.940 --> 12:00.299
in order to attain a half-immortal body,

12:00.300 --> 12:03.420
forced our dark thoughts
out of ourselves.

12:03.820 --> 12:06.820
Yet those evil thoughts
could not be destroyed.

12:06.980 --> 12:09.779
We could only bind them to our swords

12:09.780 --> 12:11.780
and seal them
within the Demon-Sealing Pagoda.

12:12.940 --> 12:16.459
Who would have thought he would escape
when the pagoda was damaged,

12:16.460 --> 12:19.659
absorb even more malice
in the mortal realm,

12:19.660 --> 12:21.299
take human form,

12:21.300 --> 12:23.779
and become such a great calamity.

12:23.780 --> 12:26.339
We must find a way to stop him
from continuing his evil.

12:26.340 --> 12:27.819
The most urgent task

12:27.820 --> 12:30.419
is to repair the Demon-Sealing Pagoda
as soon as possible.

12:30.420 --> 12:34.060
Although the Five Elements Array
has stabilized the seal for now,

12:34.180 --> 12:36.299
once our spiritual power is exhausted,

12:36.300 --> 12:39.059
the demons
suppressed there for centuries

12:39.060 --> 12:40.980
will break free as well.

12:41.420 --> 12:44.299
When that happens, it will not
be only the Evil Sword Immortal.

12:44.300 --> 12:47.579
The mortal realm will face
an even greater catastrophe.

12:47.580 --> 12:50.139
Then how can the Demon-Sealing Pagoda
be repaired?

12:50.140 --> 12:52.339
All Five Spirit Pearls must be gathered

12:52.340 --> 12:54.939
to restore the Demon-Sealing Pagoda

12:54.940 --> 12:56.219
and complete the seal.

12:56.220 --> 12:57.340
The Five Spirit Pearls?

12:57.900 --> 12:59.260
What a coincidence.

12:59.290 --> 13:01.219
We just obtained an Earth Spirit Pearl.

13:01.220 --> 13:02.260
Is it this one?

13:02.620 --> 13:04.220
That is correct.

13:04.380 --> 13:06.020
If it is needed to repair the pagoda,

13:06.180 --> 13:07.259
then take it.

13:07.260 --> 13:08.099
Yes.

13:08.100 --> 13:11.779
On behalf of all living beings,
thank you all

13:11.780 --> 13:13.619
for being willing
to offer such a treasure.

13:13.620 --> 13:14.899
You are too kind, Clan Master.

13:14.900 --> 13:16.019
It is only right.

13:16.020 --> 13:16.700
Yes.

13:16.820 --> 13:18.580
All should place the greater good first.

13:19.180 --> 13:21.539
Shu Mountain
has suffered a great calamity.

13:21.540 --> 13:24.140
Most disciples have gone down
the mountain to subdue demons.

13:24.460 --> 13:28.939
Would you be willing to go with Changqing
and head down the mountain at once,

13:28.940 --> 13:32.259
to find the remaining
four Spirit Pearls and bring them back?

13:32.260 --> 13:33.139
No problem.

13:33.140 --> 13:33.939
We are willing.

13:33.940 --> 13:34.539
Mm.

13:34.540 --> 13:35.299
We are willing.

13:35.300 --> 13:38.140
Very good.

13:39.700 --> 13:40.539
How about this?

13:40.540 --> 13:41.939
I join the Shu Mountain Sect,

13:41.940 --> 13:43.740
you teach me Shu Mountain sword arts,

13:43.940 --> 13:45.660
and once my skills are mastered,

13:45.740 --> 13:48.259
I will take this sword down
the mountain to gather the Spirit Pearls,

13:48.260 --> 13:50.019
subduing demons along the way.

13:50.020 --> 13:51.939
Shoe Sword Immortal, Hat Sword Immortal,

13:51.940 --> 13:53.220
none of them would stand a chance.

13:53.740 --> 13:55.540
Stop dreaming in broad daylight.

13:55.580 --> 13:57.019
Hat Sword Immortal, really?

13:57.020 --> 13:58.820
You are just being foolish.

13:59.940 --> 14:01.099
I am just saying.

14:01.100 --> 14:03.100
What if they actually accept me?

14:03.390 --> 14:06.019
Shu Mountain has always
been strict in taking disciples.

14:06.020 --> 14:08.340
One must pass many trials.

14:08.470 --> 14:10.899
But this is a time when help is needed,

14:10.900 --> 14:12.780
and you are quite talented.

14:13.140 --> 14:14.220
Changqing,

14:14.300 --> 14:17.299
you will pass on
the Shu Mountain sword arts to Tian.

14:17.300 --> 14:20.340
It will aid him in the search
for the Spirit Pearls.

14:20.540 --> 14:21.260
Understood.

14:21.380 --> 14:22.180
Really?

14:22.900 --> 14:26.299
Then can I say I am a Shu Mountain disciple
when I go out?

14:26.300 --> 14:30.020
You will be considered
a lay disciple of Shu Mountain.

14:30.260 --> 14:31.139
That is fine.

14:31.140 --> 14:32.540
A lay disciple works too.

14:34.260 --> 14:35.779
My name is Jing Tian.

14:35.780 --> 14:38.460
A lay disciple of Shu Mountain.

14:39.700 --> 14:40.660
My name is Jing Tian.

14:40.700 --> 14:43.140
A lay disciple of Shu Mountain.

14:49.660 --> 14:51.380
Where am I?

14:51.740 --> 14:52.780
- Kui.
- Kui.

14:53.060 --> 14:54.659
You are finally awake.

14:54.660 --> 14:56.180
This is Shu Mountain.

14:56.700 --> 14:58.499
I slept for that long?

14:58.500 --> 15:00.460
So much happened while you were dormant.

15:00.500 --> 15:01.780
I will tell you slowly.

15:07.260 --> 15:08.020
Master.

15:08.220 --> 15:10.060
Now that Shu Mountain
faces such a calamity,

15:10.660 --> 15:12.540
I cannot set my mind
at ease no matter what.

15:16.740 --> 15:18.779
Hundreds of years ago,

15:18.780 --> 15:21.099
the seventh sect leader of Shu Mountain

15:21.100 --> 15:23.420
was a lay disciple.

15:23.500 --> 15:25.139
He left because of love,

15:25.140 --> 15:28.620
leaving Shu Mountain leaderless
and in chaos.

15:29.180 --> 15:33.220
After that,
the sect established its rules.

15:33.500 --> 15:35.419
The precepts must be strictly observed.

15:35.420 --> 15:40.580
Only disciples who remain celibate
for life may serve as sect leader.

15:41.740 --> 15:42.660
Master,

15:42.780 --> 15:44.460
I never sought to become sect leader.

15:44.700 --> 15:46.739
I only wish to return to Shu Mountain

15:46.740 --> 15:48.780
and give my all to protect the sect.

15:49.740 --> 15:51.540
Zi Xuan and I love each other.

15:51.860 --> 15:53.780
I have promised to marry her.

15:54.360 --> 15:58.580
She is your destined trial.

15:58.860 --> 16:00.459
Zi Xuan cares deeply for me

16:00.460 --> 16:02.020
and has saved me many times.

16:02.420 --> 16:04.020
How could she be my trial?

16:05.220 --> 16:07.340
When you were still an infant,

16:07.420 --> 16:11.060
I foresaw the bond
of master and disciple between us.

16:11.100 --> 16:14.540
You were destined to inherit
the position of sect leader.

16:14.940 --> 16:18.380
Yet fate showed
a life of hardship for you.

16:18.940 --> 16:22.300
I wished to keep you
on the mountain to avert disaster.

16:22.580 --> 16:24.900
But the way of Heaven cannot be defied.

16:25.100 --> 16:26.879
When she appeared,

16:26.880 --> 16:30.780
I knew your destined trial had arrived.

16:31.140 --> 16:33.340
Even if Zi Xuan truly is my trial,

16:33.540 --> 16:34.500
you yourself said

16:35.000 --> 16:36.340
the way of Heaven cannot be defied.

16:36.940 --> 16:38.060
I cannot betray her.

16:38.140 --> 16:40.379
That is your choice.

16:40.380 --> 16:43.699
That is why I expelled you
from the sect,

16:43.700 --> 16:47.260
so you could face your trial
by following your own heart.

16:48.140 --> 16:51.340
The pursuit of the Dao
is the pursuit of one's true heart.

16:51.420 --> 16:52.980
If the heart is clouded,

16:53.060 --> 16:54.700
the Dao is obscured.

16:55.060 --> 16:56.860
The Dao follows nature.

16:57.140 --> 16:59.260
Follow your own heart,

16:59.380 --> 17:02.420
and do what you truly believe is right.

17:13.220 --> 17:14.699
(Demon Realm Cave)
With just you,

17:14.700 --> 17:17.219
boasting of wiping out
the Shu Mountain Sect

17:17.220 --> 17:18.659
and toppling the Demon-Sealing Pagoda,

17:18.660 --> 17:20.099
I would like to hear

17:20.100 --> 17:21.980
what clever plan you have.

17:26.220 --> 17:28.259
You are a demon,

17:28.260 --> 17:31.619
so why do you carry
the aura of Shu Mountain?

17:31.620 --> 17:33.700
I am the Evil Sword Immortal,

17:33.980 --> 17:37.220
born from the dark thoughts
of Shu Mountain's five elders.

17:37.540 --> 17:44.060
Thus no one knows the Demon-Sealing Pagoda
and Shu Mountain better than I do.

17:44.260 --> 17:45.619
Evil Sword Immortal,

17:45.620 --> 17:47.820
tell us your plan.

17:49.340 --> 17:51.339
The barrier of the Demon-Sealing Pagoda

17:51.340 --> 17:54.940
can only be sustained by the spiritual power
of Shu Mountain's five elders.

17:55.020 --> 17:57.220
It will not last forever.

17:57.860 --> 18:01.820
They will surely seek the Five Spirit Pearls
to repair the barrier.

18:02.020 --> 18:04.619
As long as we destroy the Spirit Pearls,

18:04.620 --> 18:07.740
the Demon-Sealing Pagoda
will collapse on its own.

18:07.860 --> 18:12.740
When the time comes, I will help the General
break the Shu Mountain Grand Array.

18:12.900 --> 18:17.219
Shu Mountain will then fall with ease.

18:17.220 --> 18:17.940
Good.

18:18.500 --> 18:21.139
If you truly can bring down
the Demon-Sealing Pagoda

18:21.140 --> 18:22.739
and rescue the Heavenly Demon Emperor,

18:22.740 --> 18:25.739
the thousands of demon soldiers
under my command

18:25.740 --> 18:27.740
will be at your disposal.

18:28.980 --> 18:31.540
It is a deal.

18:40.900 --> 18:41.900
Changqing.

18:42.380 --> 18:43.580
You have something to say?

18:44.500 --> 18:45.380
Zi Xuan.

18:45.860 --> 18:47.260
I want to discuss something with you.

18:47.580 --> 18:48.420
Go on.

18:50.680 --> 18:52.539
Now that the Demon-Sealing Pagoda
has been damaged,

18:52.540 --> 18:53.740
demons are running rampant.

18:54.020 --> 18:55.620
Shu Mountain has suffered heavy losses.

18:56.100 --> 18:58.619
Though I was cast out, the kindness
of my master weighs heavily on me.

18:58.620 --> 18:59.940
I cannot stand by and do nothing.

19:00.860 --> 19:02.920
I want to help Shu Mountain
through this crisis first.

19:03.660 --> 19:04.660
So,

19:04.860 --> 19:06.580
could we postpone our wedding for now?

19:07.180 --> 19:08.620
That is only right.

19:08.980 --> 19:10.099
At a time like this,

19:10.100 --> 19:11.980
the greater good must come first.

19:12.060 --> 19:12.980
Zi Xuan,

19:13.780 --> 19:14.620
I...

19:16.380 --> 19:18.340
As long as we
are sincere with each other,

19:19.060 --> 19:20.660
there is no need to rush.

19:29.360 --> 19:30.639
Unite sword and qi,

19:30.640 --> 19:32.120
ride the sword and soar.

19:32.360 --> 19:33.280
Rise!

19:34.800 --> 19:36.040
It worked!

19:37.040 --> 19:38.200
Jingjing.

19:59.400 --> 20:02.679
♪War flames rise,
the mountains and rivers tremble♪

20:02.680 --> 20:05.999
♪Reincarnation begins,
cause and effect fall into chaos♪

20:06.000 --> 20:09.679
♪The night grows thick, dark as ink♪

20:09.680 --> 20:12.879
♪The wheel of fate starts
to turn backward♪

20:12.880 --> 20:16.039
♪Crimson palace walls,
stained with blood and tears♪

20:16.040 --> 20:19.719
♪Vows scatter with the wind,
fading into the clouds♪

20:19.720 --> 20:23.439
♪Moonlight cannot pierce this darkness♪

20:23.440 --> 20:29.919
♪Who cries out in loneliness
from the abyss♪

20:29.920 --> 20:33.399
♪The net of destiny tightens ever more♪

20:33.400 --> 20:36.879
♪The lock of karma
binds a lifetime unbroken♪

20:36.880 --> 20:40.279
♪Love and hate entwined beyond escape♪

20:40.280 --> 20:43.679
♪Not awaken in a world of chaos♪

20:43.680 --> 20:47.039
♪Stars shatter, heaven and earth mourn♪

20:47.040 --> 20:50.559
♪Snow fills Shu Mountain,
only ruins remain♪

20:50.560 --> 20:53.919
♪Five elements in balance,
six realms side by side♪

20:53.920 --> 20:57.239
♪All for the sake of the living♪

20:57.240 --> 21:02.040
♪Stepping onto a path of no return♪

21:17.380 --> 21:19.259
(Next episode preview)
Go inform General Shi's demon forces

21:19.260 --> 21:20.859
to prepare for battle.

21:20.860 --> 21:24.459
Tell them intelligence confirms Leizhou
will fall any day now.

21:24.460 --> 21:27.500
The Thunder Spirit Pearl
will be within easy reach.

21:29.740 --> 21:30.819
Luo Rulie?

21:30.820 --> 21:32.300
Why is he here?

21:32.340 --> 21:34.780
Are they trying
to seize the Spirit Pearl?

21:35.460 --> 21:36.819
All commanders, heed my order.

21:36.820 --> 21:39.260
Do not let a single demon
enter the city.

21:41.460 --> 21:43.419
I am a sword immortal of Shu Mountain,

21:43.420 --> 21:45.320
slaying demons and upholding
the way in the mortal realm.

21:45.320 --> 21:47.240
I have mastered invincible arts
of heaven and earth,

21:47.240 --> 21:49.900
and tread on immortal winds
to ascend the Nine Heavens.
